  {
   "id": "remote-life-121119@1.4",
   "gameId": "remote-life-121119",
   "displayName": "Update 1.4",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2019-12-06T18:29:18.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Important for who was playing with lower versions, especially with version 1.0 - 1.2",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "1.) Added a 4th difficulty level. Now the easy mode is easier than before. This has been changed for gamers who are not experts in this genre and for casual gamers (this last version is also easier than v1.3 that had already an easy mode).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.) Gamers start now with 5 lives and not with 4 lives.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3.) On Boss Fight you can collect an extra life if you have left only one.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4.) In the last Bonus you can download 2 additional amazing 3D Statues. You can print them with any 3D Printer or from any 3D print online service.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "HAVE FUN !",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3D Statues",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Sample of the 3D printed TECHNO-SKULL (printed with home printer in ABS. Resin printers will give PERFECT details and quality).",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
